1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:04,950
The order-service rollout decision starts
with an agreement the team made before

2
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,045
seeing the results.

3
00:00:06,225 --> 00:00:11,779
Expand if the benefit and guardrails are
met, adjust when a specific issue can be

4
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:17,195
addressed safely, and pause for a serious
data or access incident or unresolved

5
00:00:17,195 --> 00:00:18,086
